{"title":"2013 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/3/1a3e2b133474ce11c66334b45297ab0eece2f3da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + \\sqrt{81} = 25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"110\" height=\"21\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> equals\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/f/31fbecaca95d154f52730e4476acbaaae18765f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 16 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 56 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 9 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 35 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"378\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using the fact that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/d/fbd1200c10c8c598136837496bec32e6c719bd89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{81} = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"68\" height=\"21\" />, we have\n</p><p>\\begin{align*}\n\t\tx+9 &amp;= 25\\\\\n\t\tx&amp;= 25 - 9\\\\\n\t\t&amp;= \\boxed {\\textbf {(A)}\\ 16}.\n\t\\end{align*}\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Cayley\" title=\"2013 CEMC Cayley\">2013 CEMC Cayley</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Cayley_Problems\" title=\"2013 CEMC Cayley Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Cayley_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2013 CEMC Cayley Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2013 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2013 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2013 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2013 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2013 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2013 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2013 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2013 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•<